    {
      "section_id":"section_1",
      "type":"verse",
      "performer":"",
      "lines":[
        {
          "n":"0",
          "text":"Easy Mac rap slick and sensational",
          "rhyme":"al",
          "persona":"Mac_Miller"
        },
        {
          "n":"1",
          "text":"Foolin' fools out they shoes like the first of April",
          "rhyme":"il",
          "persona":"Mac_Miller"
        },
        {
          "n":"2",
          "text":"I'm aimin' low, the words guaranteed to make 'em fold",
          "rhyme":"Old",
          "persona":"Mac_Miller"
        },
        {
          "n":"3",
          "text":"I'll be remembered next December but your name'll go",
          "rhyme":"o",
          "persona":"Mac_Miller"
        },
        {
          "n":"4",
          "text":"My name remains, rhymes sent to your brain",
          "rhyme":")",
          "persona":"Mac_Miller"
        },
        {
          "n":"5",
          "text":"Intentions disdained, these other cats resent and complain",
          "rhyme":")",
          "persona":"Mac_Miller"
        },
        {
          "n":"6",
          "text":"My minds bettin' insane 'til the lyrics are complete",
          "rhyme":"Et",
          "persona":"Mac_Miller"
        },
        {
          "n":"7",
          "text":"Spittin' fear in the ears of all those who compete",
          "rhyme":"Et",
          "persona":"Mac_Miller"
        },
        {
          "n":"8",
          "text":"So I never skip a beat, the kid is Swisher Sweet",
          "rhyme":"it",
          "persona":"Mac_Miller"
        },
        {
          "n":"9",
          "text":"You can picture me cheesin' when my album hits the street",
          "rhyme":"it",
          "persona":"Mac_Miller"
        },
        {
          "n":"10",
          "text":"With the words too sick to speak, so I spit it in my sleep, fuck",
          "rhyme":"yk",
          "persona":"Mac_Miller"
        },
        {
          "n":"11",
          "text":"Countin' sheep, I'm about to heat",
          "rhyme":"at",
          "persona":"Mac_Miller"
        },
        {
          "n":"12",
          "text":"Provin' anybody wrong who was doubtin' me",
          "rhyme":"@",
          "persona":"Mac_Miller"
        },
        {
          "n":"13",
          "text":"They say, \"Malcolm, please, get a new career\"",
          "rhyme":"ER",
          "persona":"Mac_Miller"
        },
        {
          "n":"14",
          "text":"It appears that they fear who I'll be in a year",
          "rhyme":"ER",
          "persona":"Mac_Miller"
        },
        {
          "n":"15",
          "text":"'Cause I'm creatin' racket, makin' tracks up in the attic",
          "rhyme":"ik",
          "persona":"Mac_Miller"
        },
        {
          "n":"16",
          "text":"See, my life changed after I heard Illmatic",
          "rhyme":"ik",
          "persona":"Mac_Miller"
        },
        {
          "n":"17",
          "text":"It was drastic, automatic rappin', fantastic",
          "rhyme":"ik",
          "persona":"Mac_Miller"
        },
        {
          "n":"18",
          "text":"I'm Jurassic, mic melts like plastic",
          "rhyme":"ik",
          "persona":"Mac_Miller"
        },
        {
          "n":"19",
          "text":"I got the gift and you wish that you had it",
          "rhyme":"it",
          "persona":"Mac_Miller"
        },
        {
          "n":"20",
          "text":"So you study hip-hop and you read how-to-do's",
          "rhyme":"ins",
          "persona":"Mac_Miller"
        },
        {
          "n":"21",
          "text":"Thinkin' that it's helpin' but you learnin' how to lose",
          "rhyme":"oz",
          "persona":"Mac_Miller"
        },
        {
          "n":"22",
          "text":"See, I was born gifted, live to get lifted",
          "rhyme":"e",
          "persona":"Mac_Miller"
        },
        {
          "n":"23",
          "text":"If rappin' ain't my life, then what is it?",
          "rhyme":"it",
          "persona":"Mac_Miller"
        }
      ],
      "rhyme":"ABCDEEFFGGHIJKKLLLLGMNOG",
      "rhyme_vowel":"ABCDEEFFBBGAHFFBBBBBBDIB"
    },
    {
