    },
    {
      "section_id":"section_3",
      "type":"verse",
      "performer":"",
      "lines":[
        {
          "n":"0",
          "text":"Rhymes is my dome's home, on a gold throne",
          "rhyme":"on",
          "persona":"Mac_Miller"
        },
        {
          "n":"1",
          "text":"Spittin' sick, burnin' holes in the ozone",
          "rhyme":"on",
          "persona":"Mac_Miller"
        },
        {
          "n":"2",
          "text":"I rock clothes that don't fit me, flows, I spit quickly",
          "rhyme":"i",
          "persona":"Mac_Miller"
        },
        {
          "n":"3",
          "text":"And rip cities, kickin' clowns that hit middies",
          "rhyme":"i",
          "persona":"Mac_Miller"
        },
        {
          "n":"4",
          "text":"'Cause the Pitt's busy, I'm sorry, you just missed me",
          "rhyme":"@",
          "persona":"Mac_Miller"
        },
        {
          "n":"5",
          "text":"I can't bare what you spit 'cause it's grizzly",
          "rhyme":"i",
          "persona":"Mac_Miller"
        },
        {
          "n":"6",
          "text":"I kick shit you can't spit wit', nitwit, sit quick",
          "rhyme":"ik",
          "persona":"Mac_Miller"
        },
        {
          "n":"7",
          "text":"And let me twist back my Pitt fit",
          "rhyme":"i",
          "persona":"Mac_Miller"
        },
        {
          "n":"8",
          "text":"The best yet, blessed to catch wreck",
          "rhyme":"Ek",
          "persona":"Mac_Miller"
        },
        {
          "n":"9",
          "text":"In fresh sweats with more words and less rest",
          "rhyme":"Est",
          "persona":"Mac_Miller"
        },
        {
          "n":"10",
          "text":"Your next guest with more swords for pressed pests",
          "rhyme":"Est",
          "persona":"Mac_Miller"
        },
        {
          "n":"11",
          "text":"The rest sweat, for war is the next step (Chyeah)",
          "rhyme":"Ep",
          "persona":"Mac_Miller"
        },
        {
          "n":"12",
          "text":"I got a passion for rappin'",
          "rhyme":")",
          "persona":"Mac_Miller"
        },
        {
          "n":"13",
          "text":"I'm passin' up has-beens with passive reactions",
          "rhyme":"$",
          "persona":"Mac_Miller"
        },
        {
          "n":"14",
          "text":"You askin' for action? I'm clashin' up your atoms",
          "rhyme":"um",
          "persona":"Mac_Miller"
        },
        {
          "n":"15",
          "text":"Your ass'll get flattened, be askin', \"What happened?\"",
          "rhyme":"Ed",
          "persona":"Mac_Miller"
        }
      ],
      "rhyme":"AABBCBDBEFFGHIJK",
      "rhyme_vowel":"AABBCBBBDDDDEFGD"
    },
    {
