    {
      "section_id":"section_5",
      "type":"verse",
      "performer":"",
      "lines":[
        {
          "n":"0",
          "text":"I'm sleep deprived, but managin' to keep my mind",
          "rhyme":"#",
          "persona":"Mac_Miller"
        },
        {
          "n":"1",
          "text":"And when rest tries to find me, I seek to hide",
          "rhyme":"id",
          "persona":"Mac_Miller"
        },
        {
          "n":"2",
          "text":"Bleed from my eyes, they've been open for too long",
          "rhyme":"$",
          "persona":"Mac_Miller"
        },
        {
          "n":"3",
          "text":"My body needs sleep but these demons is too strong",
          "rhyme":"$g",
          "persona":"Mac_Miller"
        },
        {
          "n":"4",
          "text":"My insomnia lets me spit a monologue",
          "rhyme":"Og",
          "persona":"Mac_Miller"
        },
        {
          "n":"5",
          "text":"Stayin' up writin' as the night is goin' on and on",
          "rhyme":"$",
          "persona":"Mac_Miller"
        },
        {
          "n":"6",
          "text":"Out my mind, I'm a maniac, insane with rap",
          "rhyme":"ap",
          "persona":"Mac_Miller"
        },
        {
          "n":"7",
          "text":"Raises, now my brain describes players playin' haters act",
          "rhyme":"akt",
          "persona":"Mac_Miller"
        },
        {
          "n":"8",
          "text":"Traitors need to watch they back 'cause I know just where they at",
          "rhyme":"a",
          "persona":"Mac_Miller"
        },
        {
          "n":"9",
          "text":"Scared of rap be where I'm at",
          "rhyme":"a",
          "persona":"Mac_Miller"
        },
        {
          "n":"10",
          "text":"Lookin' and I'm starin' back",
          "rhyme":"ak",
          "persona":"Mac_Miller"
        },
        {
          "n":"11",
          "text":"Hatin'? Say ya prayers",
          "rhyme":"e",
          "persona":"Mac_Miller"
        },
        {
          "n":"12",
          "text":"And that Pittsburgh, that's where I'm at",
          "rhyme":"a",
          "persona":"Mac_Miller"
        },
        {
          "n":"13",
          "text":"We true hip-hop, we the rarest cats",
          "rhyme":"a",
          "persona":"Mac_Miller"
        }
      ],
      "rhyme":"ABCDECFGHHIJHH",
